sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-sechellia-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-sechellia-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-sechellia-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Drosophila sechellia Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm (Holocene, detail scale s0) — MorphoEval overall 87.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the Turing 1952 law at λ_c = 1.500 µm, age 0 Ma. The critical-shell power-weighted wavelength is 1.5004 µm (0.03% from 1.500). The brightest oblique Fourier bin remains 1.480 µm and is reported separately. Panel D now shows the unstable lobe (σ_max ≈ +0.004) for santomea, serrata, and sechellia. Panel F places the equal-diffusion note (σ_max = −0.176) above the bars. Sweep Pearson r = 0.9996. Predecessor λ_c = 1.921 µm (D. santomea); successor λ_c = 1.680 µm (D. serrata). Overall 87.8/100 (faithfulness 87.9, reproducibility 87.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 169742c66d5febd4331e8b1fa7dc67037f33d175; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.11.2, Pillow 13.0.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 86, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 87. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_sechellia_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-sechellia-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 169742c66d5febd4331e8b1fa7dc67037f33d175, image/png, 471410 B, 1512×978 px, artifact_sha256 2182b4df9c2ef4127743ddd3d8783746a194ed23d4ed88118f208041102e9289 (sha256 2182b4df9c2ef4127743ddd3d8783746a194ed23d4ed88118f208041102e9289), spec_fingerprint 3e976ad024ca3ede382f29ba68b3901386a7d687255a0ab472b27fe393935203. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3e976ad024ca3ede382f29ba68b3901386a7d687255a0ab472b27fe393935203; artifact_sha256: 2182b4df9c2ef4127743ddd3d8783746a194ed23d4ed88118f208041102e9289; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_sechellia_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_sechellia_ovary_specimen.jpg=5a765a91794b001a..., datasets/drosophila_sechellia_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_sechellia_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=4dda020e70850732..., datasets/drosophila_sechellia_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=e61c4c157d3f887c..., datasets/drosophila_sechellia_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=20e1cd87901f1516...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-sechellia-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952: k_c from the dispersion relation, and instability only when diffusivities differ. | McGregor 2007 and Sucena & Stern 2000: D. sechellia larval trichome loss is cis-regulatory at shavenbaby. | Jeong 2008: D. santomea lost abdominal pigment via a tan enhancer. | Chenoweth & Blows 2005: D. serrata signal traits are under mutual sexual selection.; reconstructed_in_script: Near-onset Jacobians with analytical wavelengths 1.921, 1.680 and 1.500 µm. | Critical-shell wavelength distinct from the brightest Fourier bin; zoomed dispersion lobe; ablation annotation clear of the tick labels.; transfer_boundary: The CC-BY image is a nucleic-acid stain of an ovary, not an ocellar pigment-granule micrograph. | Shoup 1966 is D. melanogaster ultrastructure, used only as a scale class.; does_not_claim: That 1.5 µm was measured as a granule spacing in D. sechellia. | That Morinda octanoic-acid resistance sets k_c. | The 88 µm cellular wavelength already modelled in slot 2711. | That a second assessor scored this pass.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'A second assessor from another provider has not scored this audit. This pass does not invent one.'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.878"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single agent; R4 still open)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

